{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_bdrk_cr4xbic74vccu3loocixkaebqyfflefkyyrk6t6d4txafmqchhoq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 24 combinations:\n1. Compile cleanly (`cargo check`)\n2. Build the cdylib successfully\n3. Pass all 8 FFI integration tests (which load both C and Rust .so via libloading and compare every function's outputs byte-for-byte, plus stdout capture for `printf`/`println!` parity)\n4. Export every symbol the C .so exports (with matching names)\n\n## Summary\n\n**Feature combinations enumerated:** 3 OPs × 8 REPEAT values = 24 combinations (`add|sub|mul` × `0..=7`)\n\n**Code changes to `src/lib.rs`:** Added `#[no_mangle] pub static G_OP` and `G_OP_NAME` so the Rust cdylib exports the same global symbols as the C `extern int (*G_OP)(int,int)` and `const char *G_OP_NAME`. Without these, `nm -D` parity would fail.\n\n**Cargo.toml change:** Added `libloading = \"0.8\"` to `[dev-dependencies]`.\n\n**Test harness (`tests/ffi_compare.rs`):** Loads both `c_libs/lib_<op>_<n>.so` and `target/release/libdriver.so` via `libloading` (never calls Rust functions directly). Tests cover, in increasing complexity:\n- `op_add`, `op_sub`, `op_mul` — pure arithmetic\n- `G_OP_NAME` — global string equality\n- `G_OP` — global function-pointer call equality\n- `helper_call`, `helper_ptr` — return values **and** captured stdout (via `dup2`-redirected fd 1) so `printf` from C and `println!` from Rust must produce byte-identical output\n- `use_generated` — the macro-generated `accum_<OP>(n)` for `n ∈ {0..=6, 7, 10, -1}`\n\n**Helper scripts (not in `c_src/`):**\n- `build_c_libs.sh` — compiles C as PIC shared libs for all 24 combinations\n- `run_all_tests.sh` — for each combo, builds the cdylib (cargo test alone won't, since the test bin only links the rlib) and runs `cargo test -- --test-threads=1`\n- `check_symbols.sh` — verifies `nm -D` symbol parity (excluding standard ELF markers)\n\n**Result:** All 24 combinations × 8 tests = 192 test cases pass, and symbol parity holds for all 24 builds."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":317,"cache_read_input_tokens":63437,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":317,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"08b2ca81-d138-4ebe-bb80-426352f08128","uuid":"ad6cb7d8-8227-4422-b7a0-c182dc04e507"}
